## First test

Two assertions of one financing may not count twice, while an incompatible
cumulative position and flow must stop aggregation. The fixture preserves their
source links and reports the incompatibility.

## Actions and exit criteria

Reconcile all country dispositions; admit reviewed facts using the existing
canonical contracts; preserve duplicates, hierarchies, currencies, accounting
bases, corrections, coverage and unknowns. Build a signed immutable derived
snapshot and run manifest from pinned Git/DVC inputs. A clean reproduction must
rebuild it byte-for-byte without a second editable authority.

